# P114 on macOS AppKit: the platform's own Back -- Command-[ -- pops the NavigationStack, as its drawn back control does.
# Pushes go through the drawn controls (taplabel); every pop is Command-[. One Command-[ at the root must change nothing.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 in that order (no second 0: the Back at the root pops nothing); the final capture shows the Fruits screen under a "‹ Home" back control.
# P114 在 macOS AppKit 上：平台自己的返回——Command-[——像畫出的返回控制項一樣彈出 NavigationStack。推入用畫出的控制項(taplabel),每次彈出都用 Command-[;在根層按一次 Command-[ 必須什麼都不改變。通過條件見上方英文說明。
